android-ide-core / Aarso / Workbench (dev.fonebrew) — Third-Party NOTICE
========================================================================

This file lists the runtime dependencies packaged into the app (both `full` and
`play` dist flavors), grouped by license, and is generated from the gate's
license-report tool. See `app/build.gradle.kts` (`licenseReport { ... }`) and
`config/allowed-licenses.json` for the enforcement mechanism (§1.8 of
`CLAUDE.md`): the `:app:checkLicense` Gradle task fails the build on any
runtime dependency whose license isn't on that allowlist.

`dev.aarso:hyle` (the design system, consumed via the `hyle-design-system` git
submodule + `includeBuild`) is deliberately not listed below — it's first-party
code from a sibling repo in this constellation (`mbaliga/Hyle-Design-System`,
same owner), not a third-party dependency in the §1.8 sense. It's excluded from
the scan by construction: an included-build project substitution has no Maven
POM for the license-report tool to read license metadata from in the first
place.

Regenerate the underlying data with:
    ANDROID_HOME=<sdk> ./gradlew :app:generateLicenseReport
    (full detail, including bundled LICENSE files where available, lands in
    app/build/reports/dependency-license/)

Test-only dependencies (JUnit, kotlinx-coroutines-test, org.json) are not
runtime-linked and are not listed here — they never ship in the APK.

